    "탐색, 추적, 정찰 기술.": "Exploration, tracking, and scouting skill.",
    "Final Request": "Final Contract",
    "나는 이곳 출신인거 같아": "I think I come from here.",
    "쉬운 의뢰였다고?\n진짜?": "You took an easy contract?\nSeriously?",
    "초 차원적 에너지입니다.": "A trans-dimensional energy.",
    "허, 용캐도 살아왔잖아?": "Huh. You actually made it back alive?",
